    <h1>What is Energy?</h1>
    <p>Energy is the ability to do work or cause change.</p>

    <h2>Two kinds of Energy:</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Kinetic Energy</li>
        <li>Potential Energy</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Two Energy Sources:</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Renewable – e.g. Solar, Wind, Hydro</li>
        <li>Non-renewable – e.g. Coal, Oil, Natural Gas</li>
    </ul>

